#: 1d53f62c6ee140888d93c7ab1737ce43
msgid "DO commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1174
#: efc847879d1347a3882f586229b52a2a
