#: ../../source/docs/common-mavlink-mission-command-messages-mav_cmd.rst:1253
#: aee7768901dc41c2b3505b4ed4893abf
msgid "Sets the home location either as the current location or at the location specified in the command. For SITL work, altitude input here needs to be with reference to absolute altitude, taking into account SRTM elevation."
